# hf aug-cc-pVDZ, experimental geometry; Kolorenc & Averbukh, JCP 152, 214107 (2020), Table IV
&geometry
  file   hf.xyz
  unit   angstrom
&basis
  name   aug-cc-pvdz
&scf
  charge 0
  spin   0
  symmetry C2v
  max_cycle 200
&active
  frozen-core 1
&output
  fcidump  hf.fcidump
  sidecar  hf.mo.json
  manifest hf.ref.json
